			"Namespace": "ST_PM_Buildables",
			"Children": [
				{
					"Source":
					{
						"Text": "A building that uses plastic or resins to create molds and other products. Has a base production speed of 50 %."
					},
					"Translation":
					{
						"Text": "一個利用塑膠或樹脂製造模具和其他產品的建築物。 Has a base production speed of 50 %."
