					{
						"Text": "By using a mixture of different metals laid across eachother, you can harness the infinte power of... hot and cold."
					},
					"Translation":
					{
						"Text": "透過將不同的金屬混合並相互疊放，你可以利用無限的能量……來自冷和熱的。"
